--- renderer-before (first failing implementation)
+++ renderer-after (repaired deterministic renderer)
@@
- emit_draft(claims)
+ for claim in claims:
+     require claim.claim_id and claim.source_refs
+     require each source_ref.document_id/source_version/location/hash == read_receipt
+     require hash(read_receipt.text) == read_receipt.hash
+     require tenant_scope == actor_tenant and read_receipt.status == "ok"
